I think @greghoop  is using 0.20.1, seems that it's not appropriate to use ``len(array.dtypes)``

@greghoop Please provide [self-contained example code](https://stackoverflow.com/help/mcve), including imports and data (if possible), so that other contributors can just run it and reproduce your issue. Ideally your example code should be minimal.

And please provide the output of ``sklearn.show_versions()``. Thanks.
